  "description": "This bike features a durable tig-welded steel frame and integrated rear rack, perfect for carrying all your beach essentials. With a 7 speed drivetrain and an easy to use twist shifter, you can easily navigate any terrain. Front & rear caliper brakes provide great stopping power. The height adjustable saddle with quick release and angle adjustable handlebar ensures a perfect fit. Stay dry with the front & rear fenders with integrated rear reflector and hydrate on the go with the convenient handlebar mounted pineapple cup holder. Make a statement with Jimmy Buffet's signature and carry everything you need in the frame mounted storage basket. Pop open a cold one with the frame mounted bottle opener. So pack your sunscreen, grab your shades, and set out for a day of adventure with the 26\" Margaritaville® 5 O'Clock Somewhere beach cruiser!\n\nYou can find this bike exclusively at Walmart!",
